agent | mm1 | MakerOne       | 1.0 | market-maker
agent | tlp | TailProbe      | 0.8 | stress-probe

claim | p1 | depth    | Pool depth stays above $250k through the drawdown.
claim | p2 | impact   | A $10k sell moves price by less than 1.5%.
claim | p3 | fees     | Fee revenue covers LP impermanent loss over 24h.
claim | p4 | backstop | Reserve capital can refill depth within one slot.
claim | p5 | flow     | Net flow turns positive after the first hour.

